WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.222
Hi! Let me show you my family and their jobs.

2
00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.412
This is my mother. She's a teacher.

3
00:00:08.862 --> 00:00:11.649
She teaches English at a school.

4
00:00:13.899 --> 00:00:17.567
My father is a programmer. He works at home.

5
00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:20.429
My brother is a singer.

6
00:00:20.879 --> 00:00:24.222
He sings in restaurants three times a week.

7
00:00:26.472 --> 00:00:28.655
My sister is a doctor.

8
00:00:29.105 --> 00:00:32.170
She works at the best hospital in the city.

9
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.696
And I have a cat and a dog.

10
00:00:37.146 --> 00:00:41.743
The cat is very old, but the dog is just a puppy!

11
00:00:43.993 --> 00:00:47.755
On Sundays, we watch the sun on the beach together.

12
00:00:48.205 --> 00:00:50.759
And you? What does your mother do?

